+
+/**
+ * Unit coverage for resumed-session auto-retry of interrupted bash calls. The
+ * fixture seeds a session with the exact closer shape `interruptedTurnClosers`
+ * emits for a recorded auto-retryable call, then drives `autoRetryInterruptedCalls`
